# ─── Source corpus ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The NotebookLM corpus is ~69 MB of copyrighted books used locally to extract
# the research notes in docs/research/. It is NOT redistributable and must
# never be committed. The extracted notes are original synthesis and DO ship.
Notebook Corpus/

# All PDFs stay local. Nothing in this repo needs to ship as a PDF, and this
# is a blanket guard against a source text landing in a public repo by accident.
*.pdf

# ─── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app holds API keys in memory only and never writes them to disk, but
# guard against a stray local config anyway.
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets.json

# ─── Tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# ─── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
